---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { t } from '../../i18n/index.js';
---

<LegalPage
  locale="en"
  metaTitle={t('en', 'legal', 'privacyMetaTitle')}
  metaDescription={t('en', 'legal', 'privacyMetaDescription')}
  pageTitle="Privacy policy"
  canonicalPath="/en/privacy"
>
  <h2>What data we collect</h2>
  <p>
    When you use the free scanner we store the URL you entered and the public scan result (the
    report). If you submit an implementation request, we also store your email and, optionally, your
    name and the plan you are interested in.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use that data</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The scanned URL is used to generate the public agentic-readiness report.</li>
    <li>Your email is used only to reply with a quote and coordinate implementation.</li>
    <li>Public reports are accessible to anyone who has the link.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>We do not sell or share your data with third parties. Information is stored in Cloudflare KV under our account.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us to delete your implementation request by emailing hola@orangeember.com. Public
    reports remain active while the link is valid.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
